	<key>description</key>
	<string>Throwaway wayfinder ticket 07 probe: feel the emoji suggestion step on Alfred's interactive path - offline picks shown instantly, the Claude suggestion slotted in at the top via rerun when it lands. Calls the real Claude API. Delete after the ticket closes.</string>
	<key>createdby</key>
